  "contentHtml": "<p>2026.3.3.(화) 11시</p><p>운암고 신입생을 대상으로</p><p>&#39;슬기로운 고등학교 생활&#39;을 안내 하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>5분 짜리</p><p>영상으로 제작하여</p><p>학생들에게 나눠 주었습니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/gDd8eOxicXg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/gDd8eOxicXg</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gDd8eOxicXg\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"700\" data-video-height=\"394\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/vfoc8/dJMb85vMzSx/Yqi2DO7eDD7D0nYkY3H9z1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=744_202_998_270,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/c36cMT/dJMb86OZs7z/2pHzh8xlyVhbgUST3CWKWK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=744_202_998_270,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/etmxjS/dJMb9gxi2PQ/kKHFKangwSSNxgoaNR27xK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=744_202_998_270\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gDd8eOxicXg\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>실패해도 괜찮아!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>우리 모두</p><p>세상을 향해</p><p>들이대!&#160; 들이대!&#160; 들이대!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/82f84ce11ce0a47904004555e40e0588537117f6\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/82f84ce11ce0a47904004555e40e0588537117f6\" data-origin-width=\"1382\" data-origin-height=\"778\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>---------------------------</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">재과만의 정신인</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#39;실패해도 괜찮아!&#39; 를</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">교사용 영상으로 제작하였습니다~</p><p style=\"text-alig